<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:sy="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/"><channel><title>站桩 on 医行天下</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tags/%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9/</link><description>Recent content in 站桩 on 医行天下</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh</language><copyright>©2025, All Rights Reserved</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 04 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tags/%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>关于打坐 | 不得不说的几个窍诀(三)</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%803/</link><pubDate>Fri, 02 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Fri, 02 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%803/</guid><description>一定要花时间调整身体(三) 关于背部 背放松 微含胸 背部要注意，不要太直。太直，呼吸时气容易被压迫，应含胸驮背。 含胸，气息就比较充足。慢慢到了功夫</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%803.assets/640-1671594238595-179.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>关于打坐 | 不得不说的几个窍诀(二)</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%802/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 29 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%802/</guid><description>一定要花时间调整身体(二) 因为环境问题，凡夫心随境转。环境一变化就心浮气躁，日常一定要注意这方面的心理弱点，因为环境肯定是越来越差。学佛者都</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%802.assets/640-1671628409288-210.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>关于打坐 | 不得不说的几个窍诀(一)</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%801/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Thu, 24 Nov 2022 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AA%8D%E8%AF%801/</guid><description>气脉是否通畅 中国五千年文化有很多非常了不起的传承，比如说道家、佛家的等等。我们发现，从古至今得到一些成就的人基本上是通过打坐获得的。比如王阳</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%aa%8d%e8%af%801.assets/640-1671630296005-237.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>[置顶]站桩与静坐详细教程</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/meditation-detailed-guide/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sun, 21 Jun 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/meditation-detailed-guide/</guid><description>姿势与要领 那么站桩和静坐，首先来讲它们的原理其实是一样的，只不过我们把它区分了。 从相上来讲，一个是站着，一个是坐着。现在来讲的话，我们很多人</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/meditation-detailed-guide.assets/9109a2_7a6f160881b244028452d0f0a2b2c727mv2.webp" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>静坐</category><category>站桩</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>丰厚的礼物</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%B0%E5%8E%9A%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E7%89%A9/</link><pubDate>Mon, 04 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 04 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%B0%E5%8E%9A%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E7%89%A9/</guid><description>一、感恩·拔除病苦 最开始知道杨医生是在疫情的第一年。 有一位师兄吃了杨医生的药，效果很好。推荐大家买预防方，并且推了医行天下的链接，从此就跟杨</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%bf%99%e6%98%af%e6%88%91%e5%89%8d%e8%a1%8c%e6%9c%80%e5%a4%a7%e7%9a%84%e5%8a%a8%e5%8a%9b.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>我的抗癌康复之路：站桩打坐篇</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%97%E7%99%8C%E5%BA%B7%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF-%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AF%87/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Mon, 26 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%97%E7%99%8C%E5%BA%B7%E5%A4%8D%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF-%E7%AB%99%E6%A1%A9%E6%89%93%E5%9D%90%E7%AF%87/</guid><description>时八个月的站桩打坐，让我受益匪浅 —— 助我重返工作岗位，为我保驾护航。 我在医院的班次是十二小时的，随着体力慢慢提升，逐步增加工作时间，适应劳动</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%88%91%e7%9a%84%e6%8a%97%e7%99%8c%e5%ba%b7%e5%a4%8d%e4%b9%8b%e8%b7%af%20%e7%ab%99%e6%a1%a9%e6%89%93%e5%9d%90%e7%af%87.assets/640-1749300786263-33.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>七星连珠共修小结（文字版）</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE%E5%B0%8F%E7%BB%93-%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E7%89%88/</link><pubDate>Sat, 22 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 22 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE%E5%B0%8F%E7%BB%93-%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E7%89%88/</guid><description>参加七星连珠共修200多位，昨天又有一人跑过来跟我讲。 仍需借船渡到彼岸 在这个娑婆世界，我们身体因为受空气、水、还有很多饮食的这些限制。从不同</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bf%9e%e7%8f%a0%e5%85%b1%e4%bf%ae%e5%b0%8f%e7%bb%93%20%e6%96%87%e5%ad%97%e7%89%88.assets/640.jpeg" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>站桩</category><category>静坐</category><category>站桩打坐</category><category>七星连珠共修</category><category>养生功法 Meditation &amp; Exercise</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>七星连珠共修：意犹未尽</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE-%E6%84%8F%E7%8A%B9%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%BD/</link><pubDate>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/excercise/%E4%B8%83%E6%98%9F%E8%BF%9E%E7%8F%A0%E5%85%B1%E4%BF%AE-%E6%84%8F%E7%8A%B9%E6%9C%AA%E5%B0%BD/</guid><description>在逐步接近七星连珠的日子，天地间的能量迅速爆棚。为了更好的修炼身体，大家最好做到： 1）👉辟谷，或者日中一食； 2）早睡早起； 3）参加我们每天的</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e4%b8%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bf%9e%e7%8f%a0%e5%85%b1%e4%bf%ae%20%e8%84%91%e8%a2%8b%e6%b8%85%e6%98%8e%20%e6%95%b4%e4%b8%aa%e8%ba%ab%e4%bd%93%e5%8f%98%e5%be%97%e7%a9%ba%e6%98%8e.assets/image-20250316181452326.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>